  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a large saucepan over medium heat",
    "Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent",
    "Add the grated carrots and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Add the basmati rice and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly",
    "Add the water, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes",
    "Fluff the rice with a fork and stir in the raisins and pistachios",
    "Serve the pilaf in scallop shells and garnish with additional pistachios if desired"
